  "details": "Hi I was trying to update my VRC profile Pic in the Web site an doing so I saw the limit of the said sise was 2048x2048 so I made my picture 2047x2047 to be strictly below the limit (and so it is accepted by the JS on the site), however the api is returning a 400 bad request error with the folowing message : \n\n{\n\n\t\"error\": {\n\n\t\t\"message\": \"\\\"Invalid image dimensions.\\\"\",\n\n\t\t\"status_code\": 400\n\n\t}\n\n}\n\nI have alreaddy sent a tiket (#411499) in the general support and got for answer to post it here.\n\ndo not hesitate if you need more details on the matter.\n\nlink immages are :\n\n- the firefox requester proof\n\n- the actual immage tried to be uploaded.\n\napi call tested the 19.07.2024 and 23.07.2024\n\nBR,\n\nReogan",
